# shadcn/ui

- Use components from `src/components/ui/` before custom markup
- Forms: `FieldGroup` + `Field` + `FieldLabel` (not ad-hoc `div` + `Label` stacks)
- Tables: `Table` primitives; status: `Badge`; feedback: `toast` from `sonner`
- Overlays: `Dialog` / `Sheet` always include a Title
- Spacing: `flex` + `gap-*`, never `space-y-*` / `space-x-*`
- Equal size: `size-*` not `w-* h-*`
- Style with semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `bg-primary`) — avoid raw color utilities unless defining theme tokens
- Icons: `lucide-react`; in `Button` use `data-icon`, no manual icon size classes
